o img{width:170px;margin:0 auto;}.cta{display:block;text-align:center;}}\\n</style>\\n        </head>\\n        <body>\\n<div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n\\n<div class=\\\"hero HDLmClass97FF2C17\\\">\\n<img src=\\\"https://themarvelouslandof.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/Wizard+of+Oz+-+The+Lion.jpg\\\" width=\\\"300\\\" alt=\\\"Illustration of the Cowardly Lion from The Wonderful Wizard of Oz\\\"/>\\n<div class=\\\"hero-text\\\">\\n<h1>The Wizard of Oz Books by L.&nbsp;Frank Baum</h1>\\n<p class=\\\"sub\\\">All 14 original Oz novels &mdash; plus the 1902 stage play and the Little Wizard Stories &mdash; free to read online, in publication order, with the classic illustrations.</p>\\n<a class=\\\"cta HDLmClassE2675C24\\\" href=\\\"01.htm\\\">Start reading Book 1 &mdash; free &rarr;</a>\\n<span class=\\\"cta-note HDLmClassE2675C24\\\">No sign-up, no download. Read right in your browser.</span>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n\\n<h2>Read the books in order</h2>\\n<p class=\\\"note\\\">Click any title to begin. Dates show first publication.</p>\\n\\n<div>\\n<div>\\n<ol class=\\\"books HDLmClass513E1E82\\\">\\n<li><a href=\\\"01.htm\\\"><span class=\\\"num\\\">Book 1 &middot; 1900</span>The Wonderful Wizard of Oz</a></li>\\n<li class=\\\"extra\\\"><a href=\\\"OzPlay.pdf\\\"><span class=\\\"num\\\">Stage play &middot; 1902 &middot; PDF</span>The Wizard of Oz: A Dramatic Composition</a></li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"02.htm\\\"><span class=\\\"num\\\">Book 2 &middot; 1904</span>The Marvelous Land of Oz</a></li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"03.htm\\\"><span class=\\\"num\\\">Book 3 &middot; 1907</span>Ozma of Oz</a></li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"04.htm\\\"><span class=\\\"num\\\">Book 4 &middot; 1908</span>Dorothy and the Wizard in Oz</a></li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"05.htm\\\"><span class=\\\"num\\\">Book 5 &middot; 1909</span>The Road to Oz</a></li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"06.htm\\\"><span class=\\\"num\\\">Book 6 &middot; 1910</span>The Emerald City of Oz</a></li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"07.htm\\\"><span class=\\\"num\\\">Book 7 &middot; 1913</span>The Patchwork Girl of Oz</a></li>\\n<li class=\\\"extra\\\"><a href=\\\"08.htm\\\"><span class=\\\"num\\\">Short stories &middot; 1913</span>Little Wizard Stories of Oz</a></li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"09.htm\\\"><span class=\\\"num\\\">Book 8 &middot; 1914</span>Tik-Tok of Oz</a></li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"10.htm\\\"><span class=\\\"num\\\">Book 9 &middot; 1915</span>The Scarecrow of Oz</a></li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"11.htm\\\"><span class=\\\"num\\\">Book 10 &middot; 1916</span>Rinkitink in Oz</a></li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"12.htm\\\"><span class=\\\"num\\\">Book 11 &middot; 1917</span>The Lost Princess of Oz</a></li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"13.htm\\\"><span class=\\\"num\\\">Book 12 &middot; 1918</span>The Tin Woodman of Oz</a></li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"14.htm\\\"><span class=\\\"num\\\">Book 13 &middot; 1919</span>The Magic of Oz</a></li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"15.htm\\\"><span class=\\\"num\\\">Book 14 &middot; 1920</span>Glinda of Oz</a></li>\\n</ol>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n\\n  <form class=\\\"searchbox HDLmClassB728D03F\\\" id=\\\"cse-search-box\\\" name=\\\"cse-search-box\\\" action=\\\"https://www.google.com/cse\\\" method=\\\"get\\\">\\n    <label for=\\\"oz-search\\\">Search inside the Oz books</label>\\n    <input type=\\\"hidden\\\" name=\\\"cx\\\" value=\\\"002807121847390519013:ddj9f84mdsw\\\" />\\n    <input type=\\\"hidden\\\" name=\\\"ie\\\" value=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <input type=\\\"text\\\" id=\\\"oz-search\\\" name=\\\"q\\\" size=\\\"31\\\" placeholder=\\\"e.g. Emerald City, Tin Woodman, Glinda\\\" />\\n    <br/>\\n    <input type=\\\"submit\\\" name=\\\"sa\\\" value=\\\"Search\\\" />\\n  </form>\\n<script type=\\\"text/javascript\\\" src=\\\"https://www.google.com/coop/cse/brand?form=cse-search-box&lang=en\\\"></script>\\n\\n<footer class=\\\"HDLmClass56D53BE6\\\">\\n<p>All 14 Oz novels by L.&nbsp;Frank Baum are in the public domain and free to read here. <a href=\\\"01.htm\\\">Begin with The Wonderful Wizard of Oz &rarr;</a></p>\\n</footer>\\n\\n</div>\\n       